{
  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The analyst excluded refunded orders (status == 'refunded'), which changes the denominator from all new paid_search customers to only completed ones. The question did not ask to restrict to completed orders, so the reported fraction does not correspond to the defined population.",
    "Unacknowledged data problem: By dropping refunded orders, the analyst ignored that conversion is defined by the 'converted' flag, not by order status. This exclusion may bias the conversion fraction upward."
  ]
}
